[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_ot6hf"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Howdy Captain, my name is Martin the Martian, I will be joining your
crew as head of mechanical starting from today. I am looking
forward to working together."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_knag6"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Our job is easy Cap, we need to [color=3ba2f9]link stars together[/color] forming
constellations."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_lv1p5"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "3 mian things to remember:
[color=3ba2f9]Never stop[/color] - always aim for the [color=3ba2f9]next target star[/color] - 
and do not let the [color=3ba2f9]energy bar drop to 0 or overcharge.[/color]"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_rkulb"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "[shake rate=5 level=10]Keep in mind earthlings personalities depend on us... but don't stress
too much, I am right here by your beside.[/shake]"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_peqd3"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Cap, you are doing great. We spot a small issue on the right thruster, it seems like we will need to do some maintenance on it."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_33g06"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "It’s a good thing we spot it beforehand, we will tackle it right away."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_3yuww"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "This means, you will not be able to propel to the right in the next
constellation. It's unfortunate I know but this will save us a lot of
headaches in the future, trust me."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_81xdg"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "We truly appreciate your flexibility."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_tppbr"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "I have some updates on the thruster situation. First, I wish to inform
you that we successfully fixed the right thruster. It should be good
to go at least for another 30000 light years."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_btf0w"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Unfortunately, now the left thruster seems to be failing. I am aware this makes your life harder, but do not worry Cap, I will fix it
shortly."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_n1h6j"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "We value your effort and understanding."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_5nnx8"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "We are still facing some technical difficulties with the left 
thruster and on top of that now the main thruster is down."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_uaf6j"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "This is a nightmare, the core  gravitational engine seems to be
malfunctioning. The situation is critical, at the given moment the
ship has no autonomous propulsion. "

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_kyk81"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "We can only turn to the right. I wish you luck out there."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_nl5s7"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "So, we could not restore the system yet... And that is not it, more
bad news are coming..."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_kjcbh"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "We need to try something out, and for that we need to rewire and
swap the thrusters. Meaning next constellation you can only steer
to the left."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_q4nhy"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "See what you can do mate, we are all dealing with a lot at the
moment."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_qfk18"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Hi Captain, my name is Maverick the Martian, I am the second in charge
on the mechanical team. We can not get a hold of Martin, he locked
himself in his cabin room."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_p1bjy"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "I guess I am in charge over here now... Some updates: the navigation
system is not responding at all, We will need to reboot it."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_jh1j5"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Until the system reboots no manoeuvre nor propulsion would be
possible out there. Basically, the command panel would be out."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_6sldp"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Hi Captain, Maverick here. The navigation system is up again and
running. Yet something is off with the wiring of the controls..."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_wmtie"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Unfortunately Martin is holding the gravitational engine master's
blueprints so we are unsure of how to rewire the controls back to
normal."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_shwd6"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "I am back Captain, sorry for my absence, I was feeling unwell. Thank
god my plan of rebooting the system worked."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_twlg3"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "All systems should be perfectly running by now. This last
constellation will be a piece of cake."

